{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西營盤薄扶林道恒輝大廈發生火警，一名年約70多歲男子死亡。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_FIRE.W.TVU7.LIVEFEED.2140_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026koM7hk0m7o1792418385.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>一名男子在大火救熄後被救出，當時已昏迷，要持續做心外壓，送院後證實死亡。</p><p></p><p>現場是薄扶林道22號恒輝大廈，警方晚上近9時接報，大廈有火有煙，事後見到有單位明顯熏黑，大廈有響火警鐘。約60人要疏散。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.WESTERN-2230_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20269nTmY8Tsyt1792420590.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:14.076246+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:17:48.216725+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:14.518227+00:00","content_hash":"fc41164f92a8c514deb89483dde9e874deabacefb820e340622ab1f51e54edc7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}